# Automotive Business Intelligence

**Canadian Automotive Retail Market Analysis**

This project explores sales patterns in Canada's automotive retail industry, with a focus on understanding market performance, regional differences, and changes over time.

The goal is to turn publicly available industry data into useful business insights through data analysis and visualization.

### Data Source

Statistics Canada — Table 20-10-0056-04

[Official dataset](https://www150.statcan.gc.ca/t1/tbl1/en/tv.action?pid=2010005604)

### Tools and Technologies

SQL · Python · Power BI · Microsoft Excel

### Project Scope

- Prepare and validate the sales data.
- Analyze monthly and regional sales trends.
- Develop SQL queries for business performance indicators.
- Create interactive dashboards for reporting.
- Summarize findings and potential business implications.

### Project Status

In progress. Analysis, dashboards, and supporting documentation will be added as the project develops.
